      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "chiaki-ng is an independent, unofficial client. Signing in gives it access to your PlayStation account for remote play, your library and notifications. Your sign-in is kept only on this device and is sent only to PlayStation’s own servers, never to chiaki-ng’s developers or anyone else. The source code is available for you to audit under the terms of the AGPLv3."
